stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PENDING_PLAN_REVIEW
  PENDING_PLAN_REVIEW --> PENDING: 规划确认转正
  PENDING_PLAN_REVIEW --> CANCELLED: 否决（审计保留）
  PENDING --> ASSIGNED: 选人成功 assignNext
  PENDING --> CANCELLED
  PENDING --> DEAD_LETTER: 调度维度熔断
  ASSIGNED --> IN_PROGRESS: worker 开工 startIfNeeded
  ASSIGNED --> BLOCKED: 开工失败 / 执行密集回退
  ASSIGNED --> PENDING: 租约回收 LeaseReconciler
  ASSIGNED --> CANCELLED
  ASSIGNED --> DEAD_LETTER
  IN_PROGRESS --> REVIEW: 提交 submit（handleSuccess）
  IN_PROGRESS --> BLOCKED: 执行失败 handleFailure / 自报阻塞
  IN_PROGRESS --> PENDING: 租约到期回收
  IN_PROGRESS --> PAUSED
  IN_PROGRESS --> CANCELLED
  IN_PROGRESS --> DEAD_LETTER
  PAUSED --> IN_PROGRESS: 恢复
  PAUSED --> CANCELLED
  REVIEW --> DONE: 评审 APPROVE
  REVIEW --> REWORK: 评审驳回 / 核验不过
  REVIEW --> DEAD_LETTER: 返工熔断
  REVIEW --> CANCELLED
  REWORK --> IN_PROGRESS: 重执行
  REWORK --> BLOCKED: 返工期再报阻塞
  REWORK --> CANCELLED
  REWORK --> DEAD_LETTER: 返工预算耗尽 rework_budget_exceeded
  BLOCKED --> PENDING: 重派 dispatchBlockedSubTask
  BLOCKED --> CANCELLED
  BLOCKED --> DEAD_LETTER: 重派预算耗尽 reassign_attempt_exceeded
  DEAD_LETTER --> ASSIGNED: 人工打捞指派
  DEAD_LETTER --> DONE: 人工直接验收
  DEAD_LETTER --> REWORK: 人工驳回改派
  DEAD_LETTER --> CANCELLED
  DONE --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]
